cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KVBench, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KVBench: KV Cache Interception and Transformation Engine"
abstract: >-
  KVBench is the KV Cache Interception and Transformation Engine: a controlled
  interception stack for small language models in which the model, input and
  incremental decode loop are fixed and only the KV-cache compressor varies,
  evaluated on three branches (FIDELITY, BEHAVIOR, SYSTEM) with offline/online
  cost accounting. It supports MHA, GQA, MQA with sliding window, MLA and
  attention-Mamba hybrid models. Research manuscript in preparation: a
  controlled study of whether KV-cache compression results transfer across
  attention architectures.
authors:
